Comment: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.66,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:12.64,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:07.86,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:14.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, did you see that, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:19.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:28.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see that, did you? It's so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's winter, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:35.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that was a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:43.35,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It really is winter!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.73,0:00:46.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How was that? Did you feel just a bit warmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:48.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That was mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:41.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:43.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:45.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What comes after winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.98,0:02:47.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:52.15,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. There isn't much time left until spring! Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:57.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You need to fill up this bottle with konpeito by spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:06.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry up, you'll end up not being able to go anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:09.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:17.02,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,And when I woke up in the morning, Daddy was lying there with his tummy out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:20.16,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Really? At my place, brother—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:23.92,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:26.78,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That man's here again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.00,Default,Mom2,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.15,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home for today, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:40.11,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:46.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.41,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:50.61,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,I've yet to take one step into the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.61,0:03:53.69,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,You have no grounds to make a complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:55.63,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Try harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.31,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:04.89,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like you can't just leave kids in the nursery's care without worrying, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:08.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:13.76,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.06,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He's that debt collector from last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:21.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:24.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:26.02,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.13,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:52.74,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're Rikako's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:56.19,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried because she wasn't here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:01.28,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Oh, that's... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:06.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:10.20,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll have to ask you to mail over the official paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:15.40,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Yes, that will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:21.71,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Then... please tell Rikako goodbye for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:29.14,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She said that Rikako will no longer be coming to the Nursey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:37.73,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She's already the third child this month to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.03,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Well, with this at hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't blame the parents for being worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:58.72,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,Of course that's not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:01.08,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:03.08,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,What? What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:09.73,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.93,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,There's so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:13.85,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:14.76,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,No need for thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:19.10,Default,Domoto,0000,0000,0000,,They're all things that were lying around the house or stuff left over from the school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.14,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You really helped us out though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:23.40,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like we'll be able to have a fun Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:26.45,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,I like this one! I wanna hang it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:30.27,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.90,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't push yourself too hard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:37.41,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:38.69,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.41,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,If you're looking for Fujimoto and Kobato, they're on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:44.37,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:53.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka... looked very lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:59.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,She's still as kind as always...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:04.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,but she looked very lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:06.60,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:09.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That person...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:14.57,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her that when the deadline comes, I'm destroying the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:15.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:18.92,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if there are still kids there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:22.49,Default,Debt,0000,0000,0000,,So if you don't want anyone to get hurt, quickly get out of the way, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why does he want to do something so terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:33.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Okiura is Miss Sayaka's husband, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:35.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,He has no right to be her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:41.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... I'm going to go talk to that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:44.87,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:50.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But his presence causes trouble for everyone, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:53.87,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,He's not someone you can deal with by words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:58.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that if I just explained \Nthings to him, he'd understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.69,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I told you no, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:06.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up. Just stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:11.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If another student stops coming, Miss Sayaka will be sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:14.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's not something that you need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:17.49,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Got it? You don't need to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:22.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:23.71,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:32.24,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:45.12,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She's already the third child this month to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:47.43,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Well, with this at hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:50.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I don't blame the parents for being worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.31,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:54.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Something needs to be done...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:58.84,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,If anything could be done, I'm sure that Kiyokazu would've already done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:00.92,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I understand how you feel, but it might be better to not to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:04.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But still, I think I should go and try to talk to that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:05.38,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:09.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If this continues, Yomogi Nursery will end up shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone will be sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:16.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So I will go and try to speak with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:22.76,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:26.13,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:28.61,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Let's have lots and lots of snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:29.88,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.01,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Will it become all white with the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:33.74,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:37.14,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Here! Let's hang this up together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:38.88,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}No, no, we'll mix it together so it'll be green and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:45.33,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Cause there are also round ones around it, let's cover it with little balls, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:46.15,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,And also—!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:52.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.62,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What is Dobato doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:07.15,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:09.36,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:12.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The weather's so nice today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:13.92,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:19.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,On days like this, futons are fluffy, and it's just wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:23.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You can go and play a lot, and then come back and take a nap in your fluffy futon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and think, tomorrow as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:30.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Will I be able to see everyone from Yomogi Nursery again tomorrow as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.96,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We even went on a field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:37.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We made pictures with leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:40.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And potato picking was just so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:44.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And the bazaar from just a while ago - so many people came to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:48.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This Nursery is full of... everyone's memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:53.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This place is filled with memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:54.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:59.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't destroy Yomogi Nursery! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.57,0:11:04.13,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,Try saying that after you've paid back your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:08.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I understand. That's why we'll pay it back, little by little!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:11.02,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. Even if you speak to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:16.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:18.95,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:24.91,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,And anyway, it's as the guy says. Even if you say that to me, nothing'll change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:28.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then... I'll speak to Mr. Okiura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:31.55,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way he'd listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:38.34,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,And besides, there's no way that guy's dad would show any sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.25,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:45.03,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,But I'll be back again, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:47.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please! Don't destroy—!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:50.49,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:54.00,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, let's leave it at this for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:55.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:02.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:05.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Does your stomach hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:07.36,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But—!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:12.25,Default,Thug,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up... go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:27.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:38.59,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's...Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:40.50,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Takashi's there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:46.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He collapsed all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:01.01,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato left with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:02.51,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:32.85,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:38.37,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,The ambulance went bee-boo-bee-boo, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.37,0:13:39.47,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:43.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But now, it's time to go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.13,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:55.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Appendicitis? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:59.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'll tell Miss Sayaka too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:30.94,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.85,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,The surgery and everything went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:36.01,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,They said things should be fine from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:38.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:41.68,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Really. They said not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:44.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:46.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then shall we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:08.97,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.00,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,What could be the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:20.12,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That man who was standing in front of the Nursery collapsed because of appendicitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.90,Default,Okiua,0000,0000,0000,,Appendicitis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.56,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,He's at the central hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:26.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Supposedly the surgery's \Ncompleted without any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:27.99,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:29.41,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Caused you some trouble, I see. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:32.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. You're not welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:36.55,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Then hurry up and get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:38.40,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way you can return the money after all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:42.01,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,You get it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:45.43,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is there any chance we could talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:46.43,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:52.26,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:55.03,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter? This isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just asking if it's possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:00.37,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:02.77,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,At any rate, thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:06.13,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and also—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:06.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:11.97,Default,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,You should also give up and get out of that Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:38.80,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I... even bother calling him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:43.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that if I just explained \Nthings to him, he'd understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.15,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:53.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... that person is fine. They said he'll get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:55.84,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:09.30,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:17.89,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mommy, Rikako quit the Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:20.41,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:28.19,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you're done for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:30.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But the cleaning—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:33.19,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Today's been a stressful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:36.20,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up home and rest up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:41.51,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's going to busy too, with the \NChristmas party preparations and all. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:42.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:45.61,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll walk you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:46.56,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.48,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:54.40,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, I really wasn't able to help much...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:55.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.94,0:18:01.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi! I'm sorry for making you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:04.59,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't gained any new konpeito today either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:06.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you gonna do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:11.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But it seems like that man is going to be able to get better soon. Isn't that wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How could that be wonderful?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:17.78,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Once he gets better, he's gonna come back again... Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.75,0:19:00.98,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:04.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I made Fujimoto angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:09.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even though he said not to do anything, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:12.24,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't done anything wrong, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:13.60,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing for you to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:15.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:18.25,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:20.47,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:29.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:36.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If Yomogi Nursery closes, everyone will be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:40.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.59,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:51.28,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're always worrying about those around you, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:20:00.46,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're kind and honest and you always work your very hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:03.82,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:12.63,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I like... girls like you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:19.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:24.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, I feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.37,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:44.27,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:48.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:43.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:47.31,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:49.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.61,0:21:53.32,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,On Christmas...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:57.43,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.88,0:22:05.04,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:09.43,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:11.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:17.14,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah. If there's anything else you need for the Christmas party, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.01,0:22:19.89,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.29,0:22:27.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:30.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:31.40,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:36.87,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.69,0:22:38.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:00.81,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.81,0:01:08.48,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:03.66,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:08.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:12.26,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:15.06,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:22.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:27.98,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.77,0:01:31.82,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:35.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:38.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.16,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:46.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:49.22,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:52.81,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:55.57,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:58.31,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:05.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:09.20,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:13.85,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
