Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.58,0:02:29.59,Episode Titles,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fsp2\fad(800,800)\pos(360,180)\bord1.6}...Warmth of a Chilling Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:07.82,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Even though we all want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:15.06,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re being deceived by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.59,0:23:23.23,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}In reality, everybody can already fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:31.84,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}The reason why that child looks so sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:42.81,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}might be because she left her shadow somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:45.50,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.98,0:23:50.07,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If telling you "Thank you",
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:54.04,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}or hearing "Thank you" just makes you smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.96,0:24:01.22,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}then doing those things will make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:05.84,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}And the{\fsp3}y{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}ll make you happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:14.67,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Do{\fsp1}n{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}t worry, w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.51,0:24:19.99,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}I{\fsp3}t{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}s mysterious as to why tears roll down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.57,0:24:27.81,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,1500)}even though {\fsp3}I{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}m happy.
